 ('R5-Q503-R-ESSAY','Why does rescuing a witness change a current-status claim but leave earlier source dates unchanged?','救出证人为何改变当前状态主张却不改旧来源日期？'),
 ('R5-Q503-R-ESSAY','What must a review record when an affected party declines to respond?','相关方拒绝答复时，审查必须记录什么？'),
